<title>HUNGARY: Richter roadshow to start mid-next week - MTI.</title>
<headline>Richter roadshow to start mid-next week - MTI.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>A roadshow for the offering of shares in Hungarian pharmaceuticals company Richter Gedeon Rt will start in the middle of next week, Hungarian news agency MTI said on Tuesday, quoting an APV official.</p>
<p>APV will sell 1.8 million Richter shares, while the company issues one million new stocks.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
